e livestreams and gameplay videos of the demo! Individuals and companies are welcome, no advance contact is needed, and monetization is allowed. Please keep major spoilers, such as the culprit's identity or the ending, out of thumbnails and titles. We'd also appr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T00:00:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649840-1846651706681537","game_id":"steam-3649840","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo has been updated!","summary":"We've updated the demo for Zombie Police: Midsummer Unhappy New Year. If you've already downloaded it, please update to the latest version before playing. New players can download the demo for free from our Steam store page. Thank you to everyone who's tried it! We'd love to hear what you think.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:43:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649840-1846018067926666","game_id":"steam-3649840","kind":"announcement","title":"Free demo out now! Play all of Chapter 0","summary":"Hello everyone! We're Lobstudio. The free demo for Zombie Police: Midsummer Unhappy New Year is now available on Steam! The demo lets you play all of Chapter 0, the opening of the story. It takes around 10–20 minutes to complete. Meet Detective Zomby Akemi Kabane and her junior partner, Yasu Tamura, a fan of police dramas. Enjoy this mismatched duo's banter and the opening of a new case ahead of the full release! The demo supports Japanese, English, Simplified Chinese, and French. Streams and ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T16:01:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926666","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649840-1844751498220120","game_id":"steam-3649840","kind":"announcement","title":"Zombie Police joins Steam Next Fest! Play Chapter 0 in the demo","summary":"Thank you for following Zombie Police: Midsummer Unhappy New Year! This is Lobstudio. We're excited to announce that the game is joining Steam Next Fest in October 2026! You can play the demo during the festival. Festival Dates October 19–26, 2026 (starts at 10:00 AM PT) What's in the Demo Play Chapter 0 (about 10–20 minutes). In a village frozen solid in the middle of summer, Detective Zomby Akemi Kabane and her junior partner Yasu Tamura take on a brand-new case. Streaming & Videos Welcome! It","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T03:00:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498220120","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:31:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3649840-1843481262696886","game_id":"steam-3649840","kind":"announcement","title":"30秒ティザーPVとキービジュアルを公開！ゾンビダイブ＆ジャーナルをご紹介","summary":"いつも『ゾンビポリス』を応援いただき、ありがとうございます。 30秒のティザーPVができました！ 今回はキービジュアルと、「ゾンビダイブ」「ジャーナル」のゲーム画面も少しお見せします。 {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45594019/3d6e4708744f77c4dcc185501ea37047c1e6d437.png 30秒ティザーPVを公開！ 自由すぎるゾンビ刑事・屍 明美と、振り回される後輩の田村 ヤス。真夏なのに凍てつく村で、今回もこの2人が事件を追っていきます。 まずは、こちらの映像をどうぞ。 30秒ティザーPVを見る（X） 相手の心へ飛び込む「ゾンビダイブ」 明美の新技「ゾンビダイブ」では、相手の心の深層に潜り込み、普通の聞き込みでは得られない情報を引き出します。 人間だけでなく、動物や虫、物からも聞き込みができるのはゾンビ刑事ならでは。相手に合わせて返答を選んでいきましょう。失敗すると心を閉ざされて帰ってこられなくなることもあるので、対話は慎重に！ {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45594019/0f529509cdf8a6cebe688776b1485","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T03:22:53Z","time_precision":"mi